14. FILEBEAT vs LOGSTASH
====================================================================

FILEBEAT

Collects Logs

Very Lightweight

Written in Go

Low Memory

No Complex Parsing

Can Send Directly

LOGSTASH

Heavy

Written in Java

High Memory

Parsing

Filtering

Transformation

Routing

====================================================================
15. FILE ROTATION
====================================================================

Filebeat automatically detects

Log Rotation

Example

messages

↓

messages.1

↓

messages.2

No duplicate reading.

====================================================================
16. BACKPRESSURE
====================================================================

If Elasticsearch or Logstash is slow,

Filebeat slows down sending.

Prevents overload.

